  "title": "Baked Ham with Sweet Glaze",
  "description": "Serve this magnificent ham, baked with a sweet tangy glaze, pineapple, and maraschino cherries, for holiday dinners or any time you want to impress!",
  "authors": [
    "aellis0923"
  ],
